      "description": "LIVE/STALE age lamp with shape glyph and SYNTHETIC DATA tag.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><div class=\"ds-fresh ds-ok\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-num\">LIVE 0.9 s</span><span class=\"ds-syn\">SYNTHETIC DATA</span></div><div class=\"ds-fresh ds-stale\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"M6 1 L11 11 L1 11 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-num\">STALE 45 s</span></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-row{display:flex;gap:12px;background:var(--surface-1);padding:12px}.ds-fresh{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:calc(var(--u)*.6);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.5);padding:calc(var(--u)*.5) calc(var(--u)*.9);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface-inset)}.ds-ok{color:var(--status-ok)}.ds-stale{color:var(--status-warn);border-color:var(--status-warn)}.ds-syn{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:calc(var(--u)*.95);color:var(--status-warn);border:1px solid var(--status-warn);padding:0 calc(var(--u)*.4);border-radius:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Crew-Alerting Message",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "cas-message",
      "description": "Agent finding: severity tag, cited metric, time, and the agent's sentence coloured by severity.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-cas\"><li class=\"ds-msg ds-caution\"><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-caution\">CAUTION</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-metric\">RL_calf 59 °C +12.3 °C/min</span><time class=\"ds-num\">11:08:36</time></div><p>RL calf motor is at 59 °C and climbing while standing. Sit the dog to cool it.</p></li><li class=\"ds-msg ds-advisory\"><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-advisory\">ADVISORY</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-metric\">SOC 72 %</span><time class=\"ds-num\">11:07:48</time></div><p>Battery 72 %, about 52 min of demo left at the current draw.</p></li></ol>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-cas{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:calc(var(--u)*.6);background:var(--surface-1);padding:12px;margin:0;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif}.ds-msg{padding:calc(var(--u)*.6) calc(var(--u)*.8);border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface-2)}.ds-msg.ds-warning{border-color:var(--status-danger)}.ds-msg.ds-caution{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--status-warn) 70%,var(--border))}.ds-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:calc(var(--u)*.8);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.35);color:var(--text-tertiary)}.ds-meta time{margin-left:auto}.ds-metric{color:var(--text-secondary)}.ds-sev{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.35);padding:0 calc(var(--u)*.45);border-radius:2px}.ds-sev.ds-warning{background:var(--status-danger);color:#1A0505}.ds-sev.ds-caution{background:var(--status-warn);color:#0B0E12}.ds-sev.ds-advisory{color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--accent)}.ds-msg p{margin:calc(var(--u)*.35) 0 0;font-size:calc(var(--u)*2.05);line-height:1.28;max-width:60ch;color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-msg.ds-warning p{color:#FF8A8A}.ds-msg.ds-caution p{color:var(--status-warn)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Joint Dial",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "readout-dial",
      "description": "EICAS engine dial: 210° sweep 20-90 °C, green arc, amber band, red line, status needle, torque arc, mono readout.",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-dial\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 92\" width=\"120\" height=\"110\"><path d=\"M 15.56 65.11 A 38 38 0 0 1 68.4 16.75\" stroke=\"#3FD68C\" stroke-opacity=\".55\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M 68.4 16.75 A 38 38 0 0 1 82.03 29.6\" stroke=\"#FFB224\" stroke-opacity=\".75\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M 82.03 29.6 A 38 38 0 0 1 84.44 66.06\" stroke=\"#2C363F\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"76.1\" y1=\"33.4\" x2=\"86.3\" y2=\"27.0\" stroke=\"#FF5C5C\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 23.9 62.1 A 29 29 0 0 1 78.4 62.1\" stroke=\"#1E262E\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M 23.9 62.1 A 29 29 0 0 1 40 22.8\" stroke=\"#9FB0C0\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"74.5\" y2=\"27.2\" stroke=\"#FFB224\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1D242B\" stroke=\"#4A5A68\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-readout ds-num ds-caution\">59<span>°C</span></div><figcaption class=\"ds-title\">CALF</figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-title{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.2);}.ds-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-dial{position:relative;display:grid;justify-items:center;width:120px;margin:0;padding:12px;background:var(--surface-inset)}.ds-readout{position:absolute;top:76px;font-size:calc(var(--u)*2.25);font-weight:700;line-height:1;padding:1px calc(var(--u)*.35);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:2px;background:var(--surface-inset);color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-readout span{font-size:.55em;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-left:1px}.ds-readout.ds-caution{color:var(--status-warn);border-color:var(--status-warn)}.ds-dial figcaption{font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.15);margin-top:calc(var(--u)*1.6)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Readout Cells",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "readout-cell",
      "description": "Synoptic readout wells: title over mono value; caution/warning recolour the value; missing shows --.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-grid\"><div class=\"ds-ro\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Pack</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-v\">29.4<small>V</small></span></div><div class=\"ds-ro\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Thor temp</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-v ds-caution\">87<small>°C</small></span></div><div class=\"ds-ro\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Roll</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-v ds-warning\">38.2<small>°</small></span></div><div class=\"ds-ro\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Current</span><span class=\"ds-num ds-v\">--</span></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-title{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.2);}.ds-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:calc(var(--u)*.6);background:var(--surface-1);padding:12px}.ds-ro{display:grid;gap:2px;padding:calc(var(--u)*.5) calc(var(--u)*.7);border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface-inset)}.ds-ro .ds-title{font-size:calc(var(--u)*.95)}.ds-v{font-size:calc(var(--u)*2.05);font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-v small{font-size:.5em;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-weight:500;margin-left:2px}.ds-v.ds-caution{color:var(--status-warn)}.ds-v.ds-warning{color:var(--status-danger)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Azimuth panel: surface-1, 1px border, 6px radius, one inset top bevel.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-title\">Status · monitored systems</h2><p>Joint motors <span class=\"ds-num\">12 · max 59 °C</span></p></section>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-title{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.2);}.ds-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-panel{background:var(--surface-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--bevel-top);padding:calc(var(--u)*1);color:var(--text-primary);font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.45)}.ds-panel h2{margin:0 0 calc(var(--u)*.6);padding-bottom:calc(var(--u)*.6);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle)}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--text-secondary)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ask Overwatch Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "ask-input",
      "description": "Staff-only question field (currently disabled).",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-ask\"><label class=\"ds-title\" for=\"ds-q\">Ask overwatch</label><input id=\"ds-q\" class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"e.g. Which joint is running hottest, and why?\"></form>",
      "css": ":host{--u:12px;--bg-base:#0B0E12;--surface-1:#111519;--surface-2:#161B21;--surface-inset:#0A0D10;--border-subtle:#1E262E;--border:#2C363F;--border-strong:#4A5A68;--bevel-top:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--text-primary:#E6EDF3;--text-secondary:#9FB0C0;--text-tertiary:#8494A3;--status-ok:#3FD68C;--status-warn:#FFB224;--status-danger:#FF5C5C;--accent:#3A9BF0;--accent-ink:#06121F;--focus:#7DF0FF;}.ds-title{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.2);}.ds-ask{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:calc(var(--u)*1);background:var(--surface-1);padding:12px}.ds-input{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.45);color:var(--text-primary);background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;padding:calc(var(--u)*.5) calc(var(--u)*.8)}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--text-tertiary)}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--border-strong)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}.ds-input:disabled{opacity:.7}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Flown Dog",
    "overview": "The robot is flown, not charted. The screen is an EICAS glass cockpit (engine-indicating and crew-alerting system) rather than a KPI-tile dashboard: each of the Go2's twelve joint motors reads like an engine dial, the agent overwatch speaks through a crew-alerting stack, and every other system lives on a synoptic page that staff page through or that cycles by itself in booth mode. It is built to be read from about 3 m in a few seconds, and to reward a closer look at arm's length.\n\nThe chassis comes from Azimuth (`/Users/Raleigh/Development/azimuth/DESIGN.md`): near-black, cool-blue panels lifted by 1px borders and one inset top bevel, with no glow, gradient or glass. On top of it the booth adds two things. The first is EICAS cockpit grammar: master annunciators, severity-ranked messages, invalid-data dashes and green/amber/red dial arcs. The second is a **cloud accent** that is swapped at build time: Azure blue for Microsoft Ignite, AWS orange for re:Invent. Everything except the accent is shared between the two shows.\n\nThe whole cockpit is sized from one viewport unit, `--u` (`spacing.u`, about 11.9px on a 1920 screen), so a 1080p booth screen and a 4K one look the same from the aisle.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Near-black tonal panels; depth comes from 1px borders and a single 6% white top bevel.",
      "Status colours have fixed EICAS meanings: green nominal, amber caution, red warning, grey unknown.",
      "One cloud accent (Azure or AWS), used only for advisories, the selected page key, the attitude pointer and the brand word.",
      "Three typefaces with strict jobs: Chakra Petch uppercase for titles and alerts, IBM Plex Sans for sentences, JetBrains Mono tabular figures for every number.",
      "Instruments are drawn as inline SVG from data. There is no chart library and there are no pictorial icons.",
      "A live 3D Go2 is the hero. Its joint housings take on the status colour."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Cloud Swap Rule",
        "body": "The cloud brand lives only in `src/lib/theme.ts` and is chosen at build time with `NEXT_PUBLIC_THEME=aws|azure` (Azure is the default). `layout.tsx` writes `--accent`, `--accent-press` and `--accent-ink` onto `<html>`, and the \"Built on …\" text comes from the same theme. Components may only reference `var(--accent*)`. They never use an accent hex and never name a cloud in their copy.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Fixed Semantics Rule",
        "body": "Green, amber, red and grey mean nominal, caution, warning and unknown on every surface, including the 3D dog. The accent is never a status. Red appears only for a real warning.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Accent Rule",
        "body": "At any moment only one cloud accent is on screen, and it marks advisory, selection and pointer roles only. Do not use it for decoration.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Mono Number Rule",
        "body": "Every number that changes, every ID, every timestamp and every unit-bearing value is set in JetBrains Mono with tabular figures. Any text with digits in it gets the `.num` class.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Placard Rule",
        "body": "Chakra Petch is always uppercase, always tracked (0.06–0.08em), and never used for sentences.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Glow Rule",
        "body": "There is no outer shadow, glow, gradient, blur or glass anywhere. Translucency is used once: leg quadrants are `surface-1` at 45% over the 3D stage, with a 70% border.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** take every accent from `var(--accent)`, `--accent-press` and `--accent-ink`, and add any new cloud only as a new entry in `THEMES` in `src/lib/theme.ts`.",
      "**Do** replace any stale or missing value with amber `--` (the EICAS invalid-data convention), and turn graphic instruments amber and dashed (`ATT FAIL`, a dashed horizon).",
      "**Do** pair every status colour with a shape or a label: lamp glyphs, status-list glyphs, severity words, annunciator words.",
      "**Do** put text on an amber fill in `bg-base` (#0B0E12) and text on a red fill in `danger-ink` (#1A0505).",
      "**Do** size new cockpit elements in `--u` multiples so they scale with the booth screen.",
      "**Do** set every changing number in JetBrains Mono with `tabular-nums`.",
      "**Do** label synthetic data on screen, using the amber SYNTHETIC DATA tag."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use a glow, gradient, blur or glass, or any outer drop shadow. Depth is borders plus the 1px top bevel.",
      "**Don't** use the cloud accent for a status, or a status colour for selection or branding.",
      "**Don't** use a radius above 6px on any structural surface.",
      "**Don't** add entrance animations, count-ups or bouncy easing to telemetry.",
      "**Don't** set sentences in Chakra Petch, or numbers in Plex.",
      "**Don't** hard-code a cloud name or a cloud hex in component code or copy."
    ]
  }
}